1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Welcome to Packyo
Actual mobile-app screens, recorded in the browser. Demonstration data is isolated from real travellers.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Sign in to your account
Email sign-in is available alongside Google and Apple. No real credentials are shown.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Your trips at a glance
Actual app screens with an isolated demo pack. Plan together, vote and manage the trip.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Create a trip
Choose a destination, dates, budget, pack and travel vibes.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,250
Join your pack
Join an existing trip with its invitation code. No real invitations are sent in this recording.

6
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:28,000
The trip hub
See members and planning progress. Invite the pack and complete the checklist.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,750
Everyone shares preferences
Collect vibes, travel distance, budget and pace before choosing a destination.

8
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:37,500
Vote on destinations
Compare destination suggestions and vote as a group.

9
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:42,599
Discover real trip ideas
Open a shared itinerary, see its rating, travellers and where the pack stayed.

10
00:00:42,599 --> 00:00:47,356
Save a stay
Save accommodation from a Discover itinerary to your profile.

11
00:00:47,356 --> 00:00:52,106
Save an activity
Save British Museum from the itinerary. No price-verification panel or extra price check is required.

12
00:00:52,106 --> 00:00:56,856
Your travel profile
Your profile brings together trips, wishes, saved stays, activities and memories.

13
00:00:56,856 --> 00:01:01,606
Explicitly saved activities
Only activities you choose to save belong here. Voting does not automatically save them.

14
00:01:01,606 --> 00:01:06,356
Your saved stays
Keep stays from Discover ready to reuse when planning the same destination.

15
00:01:06,356 --> 00:01:11,106
Build the pack wishlist
Each traveller adds wishes. Expand a member to view or add their activities.

16
00:01:11,106 --> 00:01:17,106
Reuse a saved activity
Saved activities for this destination can become normal, votable wishes.

17
00:01:17,106 --> 00:01:23,106
Add the saved wish
British Museum is added to the new trip's wishlist rather than being automatically copied.

18
00:01:23,106 --> 00:01:27,856
Vote on wishes
Swipe or use the love and skip controls. Track which members have finished voting.

19
00:01:27,856 --> 00:01:32,606
Review wishlist results
See the pack's activity preferences before building the itinerary.

20
00:01:32,606 --> 00:01:37,356
Find somewhere to stay
Add a listing, submit stay preferences or reuse a saved stay.

21
00:01:37,356 --> 00:01:42,106
Accommodation preferences
Collect budget, property type, rooms, location and amenities.

22
00:01:42,106 --> 00:01:47,606
Reuse a saved stay
Open saved stays for the same destination and add one as a voting option.

23
00:01:47,606 --> 00:01:53,356
Add a stay for the pack
A saved stay becomes a normal accommodation suggestion, not an automatic booking.

24
00:01:53,356 --> 00:01:58,856
Tied stays stay tied
Both tied options display WINNER. Packyo only breaks the vote when the creator requests it.

25
00:01:58,856 --> 00:02:04,606
Ask Packyo to break the tie
The creator explicitly requests a choice between the tied winners.

26
00:02:04,606 --> 00:02:09,106
One chosen stay
After the requested tiebreak, Book this one appears for the selected stay. No booking is made.

27
00:02:09,106 --> 00:02:13,856
Live AI itinerary generation
This chapter starts a real itinerary request for the temporary one-day London trip.

28
00:02:13,856 --> 00:02:18,606
The generated result
The live request returns a new itinerary for this demo trip.

29
00:02:18,606 --> 00:02:23,356
Your trip overview
Destination, dates, budget, pack members and vibes appear before the day-by-day itinerary.

30
00:02:23,356 --> 00:02:27,856
Wishes and upcoming activities
See what is coming up and who suggested the wishes included in your plan.

31
00:02:27,856 --> 00:02:32,606
The day-by-day itinerary
Browse scheduled activities and categories without a verified-totals panel.

32
00:02:32,606 --> 00:02:37,356
Activity details
Open an activity to see its estimated per-person cost.

33
00:02:37,356 --> 00:02:42,106
Edit your itinerary
Edit the activity, time, description and original estimated cost.

34
00:02:42,106 --> 00:02:46,856
Redo activity choices
Request a replacement activity using the pack's preferences.

35
00:02:46,856 --> 00:02:51,606
Add another activity
Add an activity and its estimated cost to the plan.

36
00:02:51,606 --> 00:02:56,106
Original activity estimates
The original per-person estimator is back. Example amounts in this demo are illustrative, not booking quotes.

37
00:02:56,106 --> 00:03:00,856
Practical trip information
Browse activity information and original estimates alongside the itinerary.

38
00:03:00,856 --> 00:03:05,606
Map and directions
See the day's stops and open directions in an external maps app.

39
00:03:05,606 --> 00:03:10,356
The packing checklist
Manage essentials and clothing. Check items off as you pack.

40
00:03:10,356 --> 00:03:15,106
Shared expenses
Track total spending, your balance, member balances and recent expenses.

41
00:03:15,106 --> 00:03:19,606
Add and split an expense
Choose who paid, who shares the cost, and equal or custom splits.

42
00:03:19,606 --> 00:03:24,356
Settle up
Record repayment between members. Packyo tracks the record; it does not transfer money.

43
00:03:24,356 --> 00:03:29,106
Talk with your pack
Keep planning conversations inside the trip.

44
00:03:29,106 --> 00:03:33,606
Share and export
Export options include PDF and calendar. Native iOS share sheets require the installed app.

45
00:03:33,606 --> 00:03:38,356
Plan together with Packyo
Actual app pages, real interactions and isolated demo data. No real bookings, payments or invitations were made.

